# Markaziy tex.yordam vidjeti (0-daraja, kodsiz) — https://support.gennis.uz
# Sayt kodiga tegilmaydi: host Nginx HTML'ga bitta <script> qatorini o'zi qo'shadi.
#
# SERVERDA (bir marta, qo'lda — bu fayl repoda faqat shablon):
#   sudo cp /opt/bojxonaavatar/infra/nginx/texyordam.conf.example /etc/nginx/snippets/texyordam.conf
#   sudo nano /etc/nginx/snippets/texyordam.conf      # <KALIT> ni panelda yaratilgan kalitga almashtiring
#   # so'ng HTTPS (443) server blokidagi `location /` ichiga bitta qator qo'shing:
#   #     include snippets/texyordam.conf;
#   sudo nginx -t && sudo nginx -s reload
#
# ⚠️ Nega /etc/nginx/snippets, repo ichida emas: poll-deploy.sh har deployda `git reset --hard` qiladi —
#    repo ichidagi o'zgargan fayl tiklanib, kalit yo'qolardi.
# ⚠️ Faqat `location /` ga (frontend HTML). `/api/` va `/ws/` ga qo'ymang.
# ⚠️ `add_header` location ichida server darajasidagi add_header'larni bekor qiladi — HSTS kabi
#    sarlavhalar `location /` da ham bo'lishi kerak bo'lsa, ularni shu blokka ham yozing.

proxy_set_header Accept-Encoding "";
sub_filter_once on;
sub_filter '</head>' '<script src="https://support.gennis.uz/widget/v1.js" data-key="<KALIT>" defer></script></head>';
add_header Reporting-Endpoints 'texyordam="https://support.gennis.uz/api/v1/browser-reports?key=<KALIT>"' always;
add_header NEL '{"report_to":"texyordam","max_age":2592000,"include_subdomains":true,"failure_fraction":1.0}' always;
